<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main class="container narrow">
  <div class="page-head">
    <div>
      <h1>받은 편지함 <span class="count num" id="pending-count"></span></h1>
      <p>학교 메일에서 AI가 찾은 과제·시험·마감이에요. 확인하고 할 일로 옮기세요.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="actions">
      <span class="fine" id="last-sync"></span>
      <button class="btn line" id="mail-sync"><svg class="i sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-sync"/></svg><span>메일 확인</span></button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tabs" role="tablist" id="inbox-filter" aria-label="후보 상태">
    <button class="active" data-status="pending" role="tab" aria-selected="true">새 후보<span class="n" data-n="pending"></span></button>
    <button data-status="accepted" role="tab" aria-selected="false">추가함<span class="n" data-n="accepted"></span></button>
    <button data-status="ignored" role="tab" aria-selected="false">무시함<span class="n" data-n="ignored"></span></button>
  </div>

  <div id="inbox-list" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="mail-card"><span class="skel" style="width: 40%"></span><span class="skel" style="width: 80%"></span><span class="skel" style="width: 60%"></span></div>
  </div>

  <p class="lock-note"><svg class="i sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-lock"/></svg>메일 본문은 저장하지 않아요. 제목·보낸 사람·미리보기만 분석해요.</p>
</main>

<template id="subject-options"><option value="">과목 없음</option><% subjects.forEach((s) => { %><option value="<%= s.subject_id %>"><%= s.name %></option><% }) %></template>
<script src="/js/inbox.js" defer></script>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
